@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = paste_access_token_here
@professionalId = 1

### Dashboard diário do dia atual de negócio
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard/daily
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Dashboard diário por data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard/daily?date=2030-01-21
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Dashboard diário por profissional
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard/daily?date=2030-01-21&professionalId={{professionalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Agenda diária paginada usada em conjunto com o dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments?date=2030-01-21&professionalId={{professionalId}}&page=0&size=20&sort=startAt,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
